{"id":"afortunadamente","lemma":"afortunadamente","pos":"adv","rank":2937,"glosses":["fortunately; luckily"],"ipa":"/afoɾtuˌnadaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-afortunadamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Afortunadamente, eso no pasó.","en":"Fortunately, that didn't happen.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585957","words":[null,{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to pass","l":"pasar"}]},{"text":"Afortunadamente no murió en el accidente.","en":"Fortunately he didn't die in the accident.","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"accident"}]},{"text":"Afortunadamente, no hubo ningún herido.","en":"Fortunately, nobody was injured.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607979","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"hurt, injured"}]},{"text":"Afortunadamente, estaba equivocado.","en":"Luckily, I was wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455425","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"mistaken, wrong"}]},{"text":"Afortunadamente el tiempo estuvo bien.","en":"Fortunately, the weather was good.","words":[null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"well"}]}]}